EXTERNAL runEvent(eventId)

~ runEvent("Elven Guard Talks")

{shuffle:
- Elven Guard: Visiting, are you? Be careful around the river. Even if it looks shallow, avoid it — we elves are notoriously poor swimmers.  
- Elven Guard: Two-handing your weapon? It’s a good way to deal more damage, but is it really worth it if you have to give up your shield hand?  
- Elven Guard: Ah, it's you. For a moment, I almost mistook you for a blueberry pie I was daydreaming about.  
- Elven Guard: Here for the elven wine? You might be surprised… we do not really enjoy alcohol. Mostly grape juice, really.  
- Elven Guard: I patrol the town to make it seem secure. The truth? I wouldn’t stand a chance against a slime if my life depended on it.
- Elven Guard: Children train with wooden swords as if preparing for war. If only they knew how dull reality can be.  
- Elven Guard: It is said that the Arun Temple guards the secret of our deep roots and ever-greening leaves. Truly, we are a fortunate folk.  
- Elven Guard: Even the birds of Arun sing differently near the temple, their melodies richer and sweeter. It is as though the stone teaches them the language of joy.  
}
